WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.542 --> 00:00:01.668
- Oy, mate.
This you?

00:00:01.752 --> 00:00:02.753
- I believe it is.

00:00:02.836 --> 00:00:04.838
- Wicked.
You coaching football.

00:00:04.922 --> 00:00:06.965
You are a legend for
doing something so stupid.

00:00:07.049 --> 00:00:09.009
I mean, it's mental.
They're gonna murder you.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:13.263
- This is a bit of news from
the other side of the Atlantic.

00:00:13.347 --> 00:00:16.683
AFC Richmond announced
the hiring of their new manager

00:00:16.767 --> 00:00:19.019
American football coach Ted Lasso.

00:00:19.102 --> 00:00:21.688
- You are an American who is now
in charge of a football club

00:00:21.772 --> 00:00:24.358
despite possessing very little
knowledge of the game.

00:00:24.441 --> 00:00:26.360
-Ooh!
I know that AFC Richmond

00:00:26.443 --> 00:00:28.403
is gonna give you
everything they got, win or lose.

00:00:28.487 --> 00:00:30.531
- Or tie.
- Right! Y'all do ties here.

00:00:30.614 --> 00:00:33.367
- You don't know what you're doing!
You don't know what you're doing!

00:00:34.451 --> 00:00:36.411
- Did you see that?
He must be from England, yeah?

00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:37.996
- Wales.
- Is that another country?

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:40.165
- Yes and no.
- How many countries are in this country?

00:00:40.249 --> 00:00:41.250
- Four.
- Four.

00:00:43.001 --> 00:00:45.838
- Like it or not, Richmond
are changing the way we do things,

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:48.882
and from now on,
that way is the Lasso way.

00:00:48.966 --> 00:00:49.758
(car horn honks)

00:00:49.842 --> 00:00:52.636
- Hey, look! This car's got
an invisible steering wheel!

00:00:52.719 --> 00:00:53.679
(car horn honks)

00:00:56.515 --> 00:00:57.975
- What you're doing is irresponsible.

00:00:58.058 --> 00:00:59.685
This club actually means
something to this town.

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.812
- You don't think I see that
every day out there on the streets?

00:01:01.895 --> 00:01:03.438
- Are you kidding me?

00:01:04.439 --> 00:01:06.483
I think that's what it's all about,
embracing change.

00:01:06.567 --> 00:01:07.568
- Same team!

00:01:07.651 --> 00:01:09.319
- Being brave.

00:01:12.239 --> 00:01:15.534
- Your decision to bench Jamie
was a masterstroke.

00:01:15.617 --> 00:01:17.369
- I don't think we're allowed to
talk like that at work anymore.

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:19.913
♪ You got no fear of the underdog ♪

00:01:19.997 --> 00:01:23.125
- For me, success is not about
the wins and losses.

00:01:23.208 --> 00:01:24.877
It's about helping these young fellas

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.670
be the best versions of themselves
on and off the field.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:37.764
- (slurps) I always figured that tea
was just gonna taste like hot brown water.

00:01:37.848 --> 00:01:41.310
And you know what? I was right.
Yeah, it's horrible. No, thank you.

00:01:41.393 --> 00:01:42.936
- Welcome to England.

